# Datasets in Resource/ — too large for GitHub (limit is 100 MB).
# See README.md for how to obtain them and where to place them.
#   CIC-UNSW-Data.csv      188 MB — the curated feature file
#   CICFlowMeter_out.csv   1.8 GB — the full release, used by v7.x
Resource/*.csv
# Exception: the label file is 1.3 MB and is the repo's only copy of the
# ground truth, so it ships with the code.
!Resource/CIC-UNSW-Label.csv

# Original UNSW-NB15 (47 MB) — downloadable, not ours to redistribute.
# See Resource/UNSW-NB15/PUT_DATASET_HERE.md for the source and expected filenames.
Resource/UNSW-NB15/*.csv

# CIC-IDS2017 MachineLearningCSV (~1 GB across 8 day-files) — downloadable, not ours
# to redistribute. See Resource/CIC-IDS2017/PUT_DATASET_HERE.md.
Resource/CIC-IDS2017/*.csv

# Cross-fit / OOF caches — large, and regenerable by the notebook that owns each one.
*.npz

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# Office lock files (a ~$... file means the workbook is open in Excel)
~$*
